Additional information:


I decide to use AWS Connect with each ec2.  I named each ec2 then used the key pairs that I had already had made.  
I have 3 security groups made and used one for each instance. Each user group has port 80 and port 22 open. 
I copied the EC2 User Data script and posted it in the user data option.  
Prayed, then spun up each ec2 and waited to make sure the checks were ok.  
